OL,3,A'Shoplifting has become totally
OL,4,Anormalised': The crime blighting
OL,5,Acommunities across England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new BBC analysis of police data has
OL,8,Ffound 28,415 recorded offences were
OL,9,Flinked to just 270 suspects
OL,11,FOne chief constable fears cuts to
OL,12,Fshort-term sentences could leave
OL,13,Fprolific shoplifters free to commit
OL,14,Fmore crimes
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
