OL,3,AOpenAI boss says world 'right to be
OL,4,Aafraid' but should trust AI firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of ChatGPT-maker OpenAI says
OL,7,Fpeople should have more faith in AI
OL,8,Ffirms to keep the tech safe, amid
OL,9,Frising public concerns about the risks.
OL,11,F"The world should trust that we are
OL,12,Fgoing to do the right thing because
OL,13,Fit's the right thing and we feel the
OL,14,Fmagnitude of this," Sam Altman said on
OL,15,FTuesday during a conference in San
OL,16,FFrancisco.
OL,18,FHe accepted people were justified in
OL,19,Fbeing concerned about AI, as the
OL,20,Fcapability of the tools has progressed
OL,21,Frapidly.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
